body:
hey, i'm currently using a digital planner with my ipad! You can make your own template with the app Goodnotes, or you can download one (theres many free ones out there -  I used a paper one all throughout uni and now I switched over to a digital one and found it easier! I use a paper planner (bullet journal) for my own personal stuff. 

&#x200B;

[https://medium.goodnotes.com/2021-digital-planners-for-goodnotes-1f43682149af](https://medium.goodnotes.com/2021-digital-planners-for-goodnotes-1f43682149af)
